WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:02.040
Enough

00:02.120 --> 00:03.520
This matter is settled

00:03.760 --> 00:05.200
Those involved in the seditious poem

00:05.360 --> 00:06.480
Have all been captured

00:06.600 --> 00:07.600
The guilty minister Yu Gong

00:07.720 --> 00:09.560
Will be executed on a chosen day

00:09.640 --> 00:10.880
As for you

00:10.960 --> 00:12.720
Do not involve yourself further

00:13.120 --> 00:14.400
If you continue

00:14.480 --> 00:15.880
I cannot protect you

00:16.040 --> 00:17.240
Your son

00:17.320 --> 00:18.720
Thanks Father

00:22.600 --> 00:25.600
You haven't been to the palace in a while

00:26.560 --> 00:27.400
Accompany me

00:27.480 --> 00:28.480
For a game of chess

00:28.640 --> 00:30.000
Yes, Father
